[1.561, "o", "Investigating: How much of our open pipeline is realistically going to close this quarter?\r\nDataset: forecast_ignores_the_decision (synthetic, labelled)  model: claude-sonnet-5  effort: low\r\nThis takes a few minutes. Progress:\r\n"]
